  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>過濾箱子&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">新增帶有內建過濾功能的新箱子。（適用於玩家互動以及漏斗等方塊）</span></span><br><a href=\"http://discord.gg/a74pzUw2Gw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/838480622153367682?color=7289DA&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">過濾選項：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 黑名單 / 白名單</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 匹配物品 / 物品與NBT / 創造模式標籤頁</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您還可以鎖定過濾器以防止誤觸。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組特別適用於：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">物品運輸模組（例如Mekanism的運輸管道）</span></span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/140/creative_tabs_pipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"590\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/141/blocks_tab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"719\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/142/food_tab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"655\" height=\"799\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/143/silent_gems_tab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"607\" height=\"729\"></p>\n</div><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;或一些便利功能，例如<strong>Quark</strong>模組的快速放入物品功能。（動圖）</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/354/quark_insert.png\" width=\"514\" height=\"682\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>箱子（小型、普通、鐵製、金製和鑽石製）</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/424/chests.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"329\">&nbsp;</p><h3>小型過濾箱子</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/425/filtered_chest_small.png\" alt=\"帶有物品白名單過濾器的小型過濾箱子。\" width=\"528\" height=\"597\"></p><h3>鐵製過濾箱子</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/426/filtered_chest_iron.png\" alt=\"帶有NBT白名單過濾器的鐵製過濾箱子。\" width=\"636\" height=\"651\"></p><h3>金製過濾箱子</h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/427/filtered_chest_gold.png\" alt=\"帶有物品黑名單過濾器的金製過濾箱子。\" width=\"636\" height=\"759\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
